# {version}

```python
bazel_dep(name = "rules_kubectl", version = "{version}")
```

Without the Bazel Central Registry:

```python
archive_override(
    module_name = "rules_kubectl",
    integrity = "sha256-{sha256_base64}",
    urls = ["https://github.com/periareon/rules_kubectl/releases/download/{version}/rules_kubectl-v{version}.tar.gz"],
)
```

Additional documentation can be found at: https://periareon.github.io/rules_kubectl
